      "title": "Practice - Client updates and written reports",
      "kind": "report",
      "version": "2026-02",
      "tags": [
        "communication",
        "report",
        "update",
        "client",
        "writing"
      ],
      "summary": "A client update opens with the result, then the reason, then what is needed from the client and by when. Reports use short sentences and define each term once. Numbers always carry their unit and period.",
