      "version": "2026-04",
      "tags": [
        "project",
        "plan",
        "status",
        "coordination",
        "milestones"
      ],
      "summary": "Each engagement has a plan with 4 to 8 milestones, each with an owner and a date. The coordinator sends a status every week with done, next and blocked items. A blocked item older than 5 working days goes to the delivery head.",
